@expand_aid_afganistan
title: Expand aid to the Afgani army
subtitle: -0.10 budget. This could help delay the collapse of the Afgani army, although there are worries the money will be lost to corruption. Progressives do not support this policy.
view-if: afganistan_fall = 0 and afgan_withdraw_month > 0
